    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through a high rise city as a bird while racing against your friends (even enemies are an option) or just the clock for the fastest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might even win a crown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birb customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose a hat your bird will wear while flying</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/extras/94ab9152d1122486f0cc0e3e87cf6ca0.avif?t=1752873287\" data-has-big width=800 height=152 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online or LAN multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple 3 button flight controls</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand, but hard to master</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game timer</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through a high rise city as a bird while racing against your friends (even enemies are an option) or just the clock for the fastest time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might even win a crown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birb customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose a hat your bird will wear while flying</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682550/extras/94ab9152d1122486f0cc0e3e87cf6ca0.avif?t=1752873287\" data-has-big width=800 height=152 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online or LAN multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple 3 button flight controls</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand, but hard to master</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game timer</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Birb Game is a multiplayer first racing game with unique perspective of being a bird. Customize your bird with the selection of hats and race against your friends in online multiplayer, or just fly alone and try to beat your best time.",
